{
 "about": "Общие эталоны серий разрезов (ADR 0016 §2): ядро — tests/section_cases.py, окно — viz/section/*.ts",
 "rules": [
  "Axes: s = (sin A, cos A, 0); v = (-cos A*sin phi, sin A*sin phi, -cos phi); w = (-cos A*cos phi, sin A*cos phi, sin phi); sin/cos of degrees exact at multiples of 90 (sinCosDeg), otherwise of d*(PI/180); -0 written 0.",
  "A from P1->P2: exact 0/90/180/270 when dx or dy is 0, otherwise atan2(dx, dy)*(180/PI), +360 below zero.",
  "vertical: phi = 90 and P1.z taken as 0 (w = Z); plan: phi = 0, A = 90 unless given; P1.z = top level.",
  "K = floor((s1 - s0)/step + 1e-9) + 1; s_k = s0 + k*step; O_k = P1 + s_k*v per component.",
  "d = p - P1 first; dot = 0.0 + terms x, y, z in order, a term with a zero axis component skipped; u = d.s, w = d.w, tau = d.v, t = tau - s_k.",
  "Window k: lo_k <= tau < hi_k, lo_k = s_k - towards_k, hi_k = s_k + away_k; neighbours abut when |away_k + towards_(k+1) - step| <= 1e-9*step, then hi_k = lo_(k+1) = min(s_k + away_k, s_(k+1) - towards_(k+1)).",
  "Section of a point: the window holding tau; several (gaps/overlaps) - the nearest plane |t|, smaller k on a tie; none or NaN - -1. A line: the window holding all its vertices [tau_min, tau_max]; several - the plane nearest to (tau_min + tau_max)/2.",
  "null in a coordinate is an empty value (NaN); null in an answer - NaN.",
  "Compare numbers: |a - b| <= abs + rel*|b|; cases with exact = true - bit for bit."
 ],
 "tolerance": {
  "rel": 1e-12,
  "abs": 1e-12
 },
